{%- comment -%}
  Tiipikids — Beach & Outdoor Collection Template

  Usage:
    1. In Shopify admin, create a collection with handle `beach-time` and
       assign these products:
         - beach-pool-with-3pc-water-bags
         - beach-pool-with-shade
         - beach-bucket-set-4pc-with-shovel
    2. Copy this file to templates/collection.beach-time.liquid
       (Shopify 1.0) or use as reference for a JSON template section
       (Shopify 2.0).
    3. In the collection admin, set the template to "collection.beach-time".

  SEO keywords targeted: toddler beach toys, portable kiddie pool,
  beach essentials for kids.
{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  .tk-collection {
    --tk-green-deep: #3F5D4A;
    --tk-green-soft: #EDF2EE;
    --tk-sand: #F5EFE4;
    --tk-cream: #FAFAF7;
    --tk-ink: #1F2421;
    --tk-neutral: #4A4A47;
    --tk-muted: #6F7670;
    --tk-border: #E3E8E4;
    --tk-accent: #D96C4A;
    font-family: inherit;
    color: var(--tk-ink);
    background: var(--tk-cream);
  }
  .tk-collection *, .tk-collection *::before, .tk-collection *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
  .tk-collection__wrap { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }

  .tk-collection__hero {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--tk-sand) 0%, var(--tk-cream) 100%);
    padding: 56px 0 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .tk-collection__eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--tk-green-deep);
    background: #fff;
    padding: 6px 12px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .tk-collection__title {
    font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .tk-collection__lede {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--tk-neutral);
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  @media (min-width: 860px) {
    .tk-collection__hero { padding: 80px 0 64px; }
    .tk-collection__title { font-size: 44px; }
    .tk-collection__lede { font-size: 19px; }
  }

  .tk-collection__seo {
    padding: 40px 0;
    background: #fff;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--tk-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--tk-border);
  }
  .tk-collection__seo-inner { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .tk-collection__seo p {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--tk-neutral);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .tk-collection__seo p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .tk-collection__grid-wrap { padding: 56px 0; }
  .tk-collection__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .tk-product-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--tk-border);
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }
  .tk-product-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(31,36,33,0.08);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .tk-product-card__img {
    aspect-ratio: 1/1;
    background: var(--tk-sand);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .tk-product-card__img img {
    width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }
  .tk-product-card__body { padding: 16px 18px 20px; }
  .tk-product-card__title {
    font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0 0 6px;
    color: var(--tk-ink);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .tk-product-card__price {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--tk-neutral);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .tk-product-card__unavailable {
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
    margin-left: 6px;
  }

  .tk-collection__empty {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
    color: var(--tk-muted);
  }
</style>

<div class="tk-collection">

  <!-- HERO -->
  <header class="tk-collection__hero">
    <div class="tk-collection__wrap">
      <span class="tk-collection__eyebrow">Beach &amp; Outdoor</span>
      <h1 class="tk-collection__title">Toddler Beach Toys Built for Real Beach Days</h1>
      <p class="tk-collection__lede">
        The portable kiddie pool that stays put on sand, the silicone bucket set that survives real toddler play, and the shade-pool upgrade for midday sun. Everything you need for beach essentials for kids — and nothing you don't.
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- SEO DESCRIPTION -->
  <section class="tk-collection__seo">
    <div class="tk-collection__wrap tk-collection__seo-inner">
      {%- if collection.description != blank -%}
        {{ collection.description }}
      {%- else -%}
        <p>If you've ever wrestled a flimsy inflatable across hot sand or watched a cheap plastic shovel snap on day one, you already know why <strong>toddler beach toys</strong> and <strong>portable kiddie pools</strong> need to be built differently. Tiipikids' beach collection is engineered for sandy, uneven, sun-blasted real-world conditions — not a flat backyard lawn.</p>
        <p>Our flagship beach pool folds flat into your main tote, weighs under two pounds dry, and uses three water-bag anchors to stay steady on uneven sand. Pair it with the silicone beach bucket set (the shovel flexes instead of snapping) and you've got a full summer of <strong>beach essentials for kids</strong> in one shipment. Made from BPA-free, non-toxic food-grade silicone, UV-stable, and designed to last summer after summer.</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PRODUCT GRID -->
  <section class="tk-collection__grid-wrap">
    <div class="tk-collection__wrap">
      {%- if collection.products_count > 0 -%}
        <div class="tk-collection__grid">
          {%- for product in collection.products -%}
            <a class="tk-product-card" href="{{ product.url }}" aria-label="View {{ product.title | escape }}">
              <div class="tk-product-card__img">
                {%- if product.featured_image -%}
                  <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                       alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | default: product.title | escape }}"
                       loading="lazy" width="800" height="800">
                {%- else -%}
                  <span>[Product image]</span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
              <div class="tk-product-card__body">
                <h2 class="tk-product-card__title">{{ product.title }}</h2>
                <div class="tk-product-card__price">
                  {{ product.price | money }}
                  {%- unless product.available -%}
                    <span class="tk-product-card__unavailable">— Sold out</span>
                  {%- endunless -%}
                </div>
              </div>
            </a>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- else -%}
        <div class="tk-collection__empty">No products in this collection yet — check back soon.</div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

{%- comment -%} JSON-LD CollectionPage schema {%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "Beach & Outdoor",
  "description": "Toddler beach toys, portable kiddie pools, and beach essentials for kids. Silicone bucket sets and anchored beach pools built for real beach conditions.",
  "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ collection.url }}",
  "inLanguage": "en",
  "isPartOf": {
    "@type": "WebSite",
    "name": "{{ shop.name | escape }}",
    "url": "{{ shop.url }}"
  },
  "mainEntity": {
    "@type": "ItemList",
    "numberOfItems": {{ collection.products_count | default: 0 }},
    "itemListElement": [
      {%- for product in collection.products limit: 20 -%}
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": {{ forloop.index }},
        "url": "{{ shop.url }}{{ product.url }}",
        "name": {{ product.title | json }}
      }{%- unless forloop.last -%},{%- endunless -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    ]
  }
}
</script>
